<title>Global Crude Oil Price Trends: A Historical Analysis (1970–2026)</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0f1117;
    --surface: #1a1d27;
    --surface2: #22263a;
    --border: #2e3350;
    --accent: #e8a838;
    --accent2: #4e9eff;
    --accent3: #f05c5c;
    --accent4: #50d890;
    --text: #e4e6f0;
    --text-muted: #8b90aa;
    --text-dim: #5a5f78;
    --header-h: 72px;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  a { color: var(--accent2); }

  /* ── HEADER ── */
  header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1117 0%, #1a1d27 60%, #141820 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 48px 64px 40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -60px; right: -80px;
    width: 400px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(232,168,56,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .report-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(232,168,56,0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(232,168,56,0.3);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  header h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #fff;
    max-width: 780px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  header .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .meta-row span strong { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ── LAYOUT ── */
  main { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 48px 80px; }

  /* ── KPI STRIP ── */
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .kpi-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .kpi-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px 20px 16px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .kpi-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--kpi-color, var(--accent));
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
  }
  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .kpi-value {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .kpi-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  /* ── SECTION ── */
  section { margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .section-num {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 12px; max-width: 820px; }

  /* ── CHART CONTAINER ── */
  .chart-wrap {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 28px 28px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .chart-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .chart-desc {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  canvas { display: block; width: 100% !important; }

  /* ── ANNOTATION BADGES ── */
  .event-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .event-item {
    background: var(--surface2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--item-color, var(--accent));
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
  }
  .event-date { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dim); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .event-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .event-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.5; }

  /* ── DECADE TABLE ── */
  .decade-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .decade-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .decade-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--dc-color, var(--accent));
  }
  .decade-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .decade-stat-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .decade-stat-row .stat-label { color: var(--text-dim); }
  .decade-stat-row .stat-val { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .decade-bar-wrap { margin-top: 12px; }
  .decade-bar-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .decade-bar-bg { background: var(--surface2); border-radius: 3px; height: 6px; }
  .decade-bar-fill { height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--dc-color, var(--accent)); }

  /* ── STATS TABLE ── */
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
  thead th {
    background: var(--surface2);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  tbody td { padding: 11px 16px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  tbody td:first-child { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  tbody tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }
  .tbl-num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .up { color: var(--accent4); }
  .dn { color: var(--accent3); }

  /* ── VOLATILITY HEATMAP ── */
  .shock-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .shock-card {
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .shock-card h4 { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .shock-entry { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 13px; }
  .shock-entry .s-label { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .shock-entry .s-val { font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  /* ── DIST SECTION ── */
  .dist-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .dist-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* ── CONCLUSION BOX ── */
  .conclusion-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(232,168,56,0.07) 0%, rgba(78,158,255,0.05) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232,168,56,0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .conclusion-box h3 { color: var(--accent); margin-top: 0; }
  .conclusion-box p { max-width: 100%; }
  .takeaway-list { list-style: none; margin: 16px 0; }
  .takeaway-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .takeaway-list li::before { content: '→'; color: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: 700; }

  footer {
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 28px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 11.5px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ HEADER -->
<header>
  <div class="report-tag">Trend Analysis Report</div>
  <h1>Global Crude Oil Price Trends<br>A Historical Analysis (1970–2026)</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">A data-driven examination of monthly crude oil prices across five decades — covering geopolitical shocks, structural price regimes, volatility episodes, and long-term growth dynamics.</p>
  <div class="meta-row">
    <span><strong>Dataset:</strong> 675 monthly observations</span>
    <span><strong>Period:</strong> January 1970 – March 2026</span>
    <span><strong>Unit:</strong> USD per barrel (nominal)</span>
    <span><strong>Source:</strong> Global Fuel Price Trends (Kaggle)</span>
    <span><strong>Published:</strong> April 2026</span>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ KPI STRIP -->
<div class="kpi-grid" style="margin-top: 40px;">
  <div class="kpi-card" style="--kpi-color: var(--accent);">
    <div class="kpi-label">Price Range</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">$131.62</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">$1.21 → $132.83 / bbl</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card" style="--kpi-color: var(--accent4);">
    <div class="kpi-label">CAGR (1970→2026)</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">7.93%</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">56.2 years compound growth</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card" style="--kpi-color: var(--accent2);">
    <div class="kpi-label">Overall Std Dev</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">$30.59</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">Population std deviation</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card" style="--kpi-color: var(--accent3);">
    <div class="kpi-label">Max Monthly Change</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">+217%</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">Jan 1974 (+$8.90 / bbl)</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card" style="--kpi-color: #c97ff5;">
    <div class="kpi-label">Highest Avg Decade</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">2010s</div>
    <div class="kpi-sub">Average $76.45 / bbl</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ SECTION 1: EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW -->
<section id="executive-overview">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-num">01</span>
    <h2>Executive Overview</h2>
  </div>

  <p>This report analyzes 675 monthly crude oil price observations from January 1970 through March 2026, covering the full spectrum of modern energy market history. From a baseline of just $1.21/bbl in 1970, crude oil prices have undergone dramatic structural transformations driven by geopolitical upheaval, technological disruption, demand shocks, and cartel dynamics — ultimately reaching a dataset maximum of $132.83/bbl in July 2008.</p>

  <p>The compound annual growth rate across the full 56-year period stands at <strong>7.93%</strong> — a figure that masks extraordinary intra-period volatility. The standard deviation of $30.59 relative to a mean of $39.80 underscores that price dispersion, not trend, is the defining statistical characteristic of crude oil markets. No decade has been immune: the 1970s oil shocks, the 1980s price collapse, the 2000s supercycle, and the 2020 pandemic demand destruction have all left structural fingerprints on the data.</p>

  <p>The 2010s recorded the highest average decade price ($76.45/bbl), while the 1970s and 1990s averaged $9.70 and $18.19 respectively — illustrating how dramatically the pricing regime has shifted upward since the pre-embargo era. The most recent data (2025–2026) shows prices in the $60–$88 range, suggesting a moderate-price regime following the post-COVID supercycle.</p>

  <div class="event-list" style="margin-top: 24px;">
    <div class="event-item" style="--item-color: var(--accent);">
      <div class="event-date">Dataset Extremes</div>
      <div class="event-title">$1.21 – $132.83 / bbl</div>
      <div class="event-desc">An 11,000% price range spanning Jan 1970 (minimum) to Jul 2008 (maximum)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="event-item" style="--item-color: var(--accent4);">
      <div class="event-date">Long-Run Growth</div>
      <div class="event-title">7.93% CAGR Over 56 Years</div>
      <div class="event-desc">Sustained above-inflation growth despite multiple near-total collapse episodes</div>
    </div>
    <div class="event-item" style="--item-color: var(--accent3);">
      <div class="event-date">Extreme Shock</div>
      <div class="event-title">+217% in January 1974</div>
      <div class="event-desc">Largest single-month percentage surge; OPEC embargo drives $4.10→$13.00 overnight</div>
    </div>
    <div class="event-item" style="--item-color: var(--accent2);">
      <div class="event-date">Peak Decade</div>
      <div class="event-title">2010s — Avg $76.45/bbl</div>
      <div class="event-desc">Highest average price across any decade in the dataset</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ SECTION 2: LONG-TERM TREND -->
<section id="long-term-trend">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-num">02</span>
    <h2>Long-Term Price Trajectory (1970–2026)</h2>
  </div>

  <p>The full time series reveals four distinct structural price regimes: the pre-crisis stability period (1970–1972), the OPEC-era step-changes (1973–1985), the prolonged low-price era (1986–1999), and the modern high-price environment (2000–present). Each transition was triggered by a discrete geopolitical or macroeconomic shock rather than gradual drift — a pattern that defines crude oil's price dynamics.</p>

  <div class="chart-wrap">
    <div class="chart-title">Monthly Crude Oil Price — Full Time Series (1970–2026)</div>
    <div class="chart-desc">USD per barrel · Monthly observations · Key events annotated</div>
    <canvas id="chartMain" height="380"></canvas>
  </div>

  <h3>Key Inflection Points</h3>
  <div class="event-list">
    <div class="event-item" style="--item-color: #f5a623;">
      <div class="event-date">Oct 1973 – Jan 1974</div>
      <div class="event-title">First OPEC Oil Embargo</div>
      <div class="event-desc">Price surged from $2.70 to $13.00 (+382%) in three months, permanently resetting the global oil price floor</div>
    </div>
    <div class="event-item" style="--item-color: #f05c5c;">
      <div class="event-date">Jan 1979 – Nov 1980</div>
      <div class="event-title">Iranian Revolution / Iran-Iraq War</div>
      <div class="event-desc">Second shock: prices climbed from $14.50 (Dec 1978) to $40.75 (Nov 1979), a +181% move in under 12 months</div>
    </div>
    <div class="event-item" style="--item-color: #4e9eff;">
      <div class="event-date">Jan – Jul 1986</div>
      <div class="event-title">OPEC Price Collapse</div>
      <div class="event-desc">Saudi Arabia abandons production quotas; price fell from $26.50 to $9.62/bbl (−64%) — the largest absolute bear market to that point</div>
    </div>
    <div class="event-item" style="--item-color: #50d890;">
      <div class="event-date">Aug – Oct 1990</div>
      <div class="event-title">Gulf War I Spike</div>
      <div class="event-desc">Iraq invades Kuwait; price spiked from $15.27 to $34.50 (+126%) within 3 months before rapid post-war normalization</div>
    </div>
    <div class="event-item" style="--item-color: #f5a623;">
